 #:seon.task{:name "a-published-root-costs-a-template-clone-not-a-publication"
             :intent "`seon.test-support/populate-published-root!` publishes the whole checkout into each test's own store (`seon.cluster/refresh-source!`): 44,846 ms of a 61,207 ms body in `seon.blob-publication-test` before it stopped using it (one check JVM, 2026-10-12), and each of the 19 callers pays it again, so every `seon.cluster.armed-test` member exceeds its 5,000 ms bound before its own work starts and the central round abandons it. The operator already clones a published template store per commit for its check JVMs (`seeded-store!` in script/seon/operator.clj). Done when a published root costs a copy-on-write clone of one template published once per program content, the root's store then behaving as a freshly published one, and an armed-test member's setup is measured under its bound. Read `docs/research/agent-platform/2026-10-12/agent-hangs.md` and `script/seon/operator.clj`."}
 #:seon.task{:name "overlay-file-frontend-read-during-warming"
             :intent "`datahike.versioning/branch!` over the proposed file frontend for `datahike.store/overlay-frontend` must read its inherited head successfully. `konserve.tiered/warm!` currently runs asynchronously after an inherited EDN read; `konserve.impl.defaults/io-operation` creates the final file before `konserve.impl.defaults/update-blob` installs its contents, so the next read can see an empty file. Repair that producer path and add a deterministic regression before accepting the file overlay. Cleanup currently masks the primary exception with :database-has-active-connections. The owner deferred this fork work; the Seon fixture uses :tiered in the meantime. Read `docs/research/agent-platform/2026-10-12/fixture-hour.md`, `docs/research/agent-platform/2026-10-12/fixture-hour/fork-batch/datahike-candidate.patch`, `docs/research/agent-platform/2026-10-12/fixture-hour/fork-batch/fork-batch-datahike-cause-current.txt` and `docs/research/agent-platform/2026-10-12/fixture-hour/fork-batch/overlay-cause.clj`."}
